      description: "Québec construction-compliance monitoring: RBQ contractor-licence verification plus RENA (AMP) ineligibility status, with a company watchlist keyed on NEQ. Sources: Régie du bâtiment du Québec (CC BY 4.0) and Autorité des marchés publics (AMP)."
